  "title": "Cape Cod Cocktail Meatballs",
  "description": "This sweet and tangy Cape Cod cocktail meatballs recipe is baked in cranberry sauce until the sauce becomes a glaze and enrobes meatballs with flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Robin Myshrall Ulery"
  ],
